-# Persistent indicator for consults started with ?debug=true.
.alert.alert-warning.border.border-warning.mb-3{ role: "status", "aria-live" => "polite" }
  .d-flex.align-items-start.gap-2
    %i.bi.bi-bug-fill.fs-4.flex-shrink-0{ "aria-hidden" => "true" }
    %div
      %div.fw-semibold.mb-1 Prompt debug mode is on for this consult
      %p.mb-2.small
        This run is for honing the transcript → OGO prompt. Behavior differs from a normal consult:
      %ul.mb-2.small.ps-3
        %li
          Fix the
          %strong Speaker map
          first (Ignore audio-share labels; resolve
          %strong ?
          rows).
        %li
          After extraction, use the transcript pane — click cues or
          %strong Show in transcript
          on a pOGO.
        %li
          Use
          %strong Would include
          /
          %strong Dismiss
          +
          %strong Save labels (no drafts)
          (no OGOs created).
        %li
          Download the
          %strong prompt-debug JSON
          and re-run Consult OG again on this same transcript.
      %p.mb-0.small.text-muted
        Started via #{content_tag(:code, "?debug=true")}. Normal consults omit that param.
